          "end_line": 747,
          "expected": "both wrappers strip routed backend key, delegate delete/adelete, then replace any non-None result.path with original caller path."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "D5",
      "point": "Composite capability does not imply all routes support deletion",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "libs/deepagents/deepagents/backends/composite.py",
          "start_line": 713,
          "end_line": 747,
          "expected": "Composite overrides delete so gate admits it, but selected routed backend may not implement delete. Both sync/async catch NotImplementedError and return DeleteResult(error). Do not remove this handling or infer support for every route."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "D6",
      "point": "State deletion mutates through reducer tombstones",
